## Current CLI Structure
- `src/cli.rs`: CLI types + run entrypoint + delegates to builders/commands.
- `src/cli/config_builder.rs`: `Cli -> Config` mapping and transfer-arg validation.
- `src/cli/commands/*.rs`: command execution orchestration.

